title: Azure Firewall: Metrics
agents: azure
catalog: cloud/azure
license: GPLv2
distribution: kuhn-ruess
description:
 This check evaluates the Azure Monitor metrics of an Azure Firewall that the
 Azure Extra special agent collects: the firewall health in percent, the
 network rule hits within the last minute and the average throughput of the
 last minute.

 The firewall health is {WARN} below 90% and {CRIT} below 50% by default.
 Upper levels for the network rule hits and upper and lower levels for the
 throughput (in Mbit/s) can be set with the rule "Azure Extra: Firewall
 metrics". They have no levels by default.

item:
 The name of the firewall.

discovery:
 One service is created for each firewall that reports metrics.

perfdata:
 firewall_health (percent), networkrulehit (hits per minute) and
 throughput (bits per second).
